---
smd: 1
title: Display math in containers
summary: Pins how `$$` display math reads inside containers, so later releases are compared against it. Math is opaque, as code is, so a line of colons inside it never closes a container.
status: draft
updated: 2026-10-15
---

## Math in a callout

:::note Ratios
The ratio is defined over the whole interval:

$$
\frac{a}{b}
:::
\frac{c}{d}
$$

Still inside the note, after the math.
:::

Outside the note.

